{"content_hash": "6c8a15e6b21e3558", "version_id": 861, "article_id": 87, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Card brand Hitcard may buy a solar glass company", "title_zh": "卡牌品牌Hitcard可能要买下一家光伏玻璃公司", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8192045.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589759829060-eb3e3a77cdee?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8aGl0Y2FyZHxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzNzU2MTA1fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Fearghal Kelly on Unsplash", "author": "Fearghal Kelly", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@fgal?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-5OgIsvOO1Rk?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(21, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(59, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "f08d1f69b25e"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-04", "word_count": 90, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "A card company in China wants to buy a big part of a solar glass company. This could help the card company sell shares to the public.", "lead_zh": "中国一家卡牌公司想买下一家光伏玻璃公司的一大部分股份。这可能帮这家卡牌公司上市。", "preview": "On November 2, Yamadun said it will sell 20% of its shares. The buyer is Shanghai Qixing, the company behind the card brand Hitcard. Yamadun", "preview_zh": "11月2日，亚玛顿表示将出售20%的股份。买方是上海骑形，即卡牌品牌Hitcard的运营方。亚玛顿股票于11月3日停牌。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 844, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 32.65, "size_bytes": 196848, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 108, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 33.125, "size_bytes": 199728, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 108, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 35.6, "size_bytes": 214560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 108, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 31.0, "size_bytes": 186912, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 108, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/87/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 33.8, "size_bytes": 203760, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 108, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/87/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@1fa389e/content/data/versions/861.json", "paragraphs": ["On November 2, Yamadun said it will sell 20% of its shares. The buyer is Shanghai Qixing, the company behind the card brand Hitcard. Yamadun shares stopped trading on November 3.", "Hitcard makes cards for adult fans. It wants to sell shares to the public, but this is hard now. So it may use Yamadun instead. The deal needs a big restructuring first.", "Yamadun makes glass for solar panels. Solar prices fell, so the company lost money for three years. The Lin family, which controls Yamadun, will still hold 14.90%."], "paragraphs_zh": ["11月2日，亚玛顿表示将出售20%的股份。买方是上海骑形，即卡牌品牌Hitcard的运营方。亚玛顿股票于11月3日停牌。", "Hitcard为成年粉丝制作卡牌。它想上市，但现在很难。所以它可能转而借助亚玛顿。这笔交易需要先进行大规模重组。", "亚玛顿生产太阳能电池板用的玻璃。光伏价格下跌，因此公司连续三年亏损。控股亚玛顿的林氏家族仍将持有14.90%的股份。"], "body": "On November 2, Yamadun said it will sell 20% of its shares. The buyer is Shanghai Qixing, the company behind the card brand Hitcard. Yamadun shares stopped trading on November 3.\n\nHitcard makes cards for adult fans. It wants to sell shares to the public, but this is hard now. So it may use Yamadun instead. The deal needs a big restructuring first.\n\nYamadun makes glass for solar panels. Solar prices fell, so the company lost money for three years. The Lin family, which controls Yamadun, will still hold 14.90%.", "body_zh": "11月2日，亚玛顿表示将出售20%的股份。买方是上海骑形，即卡牌品牌Hitcard的运营方。亚玛顿股票于11月3日停牌。\n\nHitcard为成年粉丝制作卡牌。它想上市，但现在很难。所以它可能转而借助亚玛顿。这笔交易需要先进行大规模重组。\n\n亚玛顿生产太阳能电池板用的玻璃。光伏价格下跌，因此公司连续三年亏损。控股亚玛顿的林氏家族仍将持有14.90%的股份。", "text": "On November 2, Yamadun said it will sell 20% of its shares. The buyer is Shanghai Qixing, the company behind the card brand Hitcard. Yamadun shares stopped trading on November 3. Hitcard makes cards for adult fans. It wants to sell shares to the public, but this is hard now. So it may use Yamadun instead. The deal needs a big restructuring first. Yamadun makes glass for solar panels. Solar prices fell, so the company lost money for three years. The Lin family, which controls Yamadun, will still hold 14.90%.", "vocab": [{"word": "buy", "pos": "verb", "zh": "买", "note": "最基础的动作词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sell", "pos": "verb", "zh": "卖", "note": "与 buy 相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "公司股份常用复数 shares", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "company", "pos": "noun", "zh": "公司", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "card", "pos": "noun", "zh": "卡牌", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "money", "pos": "noun", "zh": "钱", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hard", "pos": "adj", "zh": "困难的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hold", "pos": "verb", "zh": "持有", "note": "hold shares 持有股份", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-04T01:35:03.845173", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s":